  "id": "JMAP-cayv.8",
  "title": "contacts-server: AddressBook name/description localizable; ContactCard excluded",
  "description": "jmap-contacts-server (with contacts-types): AddressBook `name` and `description` are localizable.\n- name: not nullable. description: nullable; a null localized value means no description in that language.\n- ContactCard is excluded: it keeps JSContact's own language/localizations (RFC 9553 2.1.5, 2.7.1), and `language` on ContactCard/get is invalidArguments.\nFollows the mail-server pattern (previous child).\n",
